{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14682","headline":"酬袁太祝长卿小湖村山居书怀见寄 · 戴叔伦","name":"酬袁太祝长卿小湖村山居书怀见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"背江居隙地，辞职作遗人。\n耕凿资余力，樵渔逐四邻。\n麦秋桑叶大，梅雨稻田新。\n篱落栽山果，池塘养海鳞。\n放歌聊自足，幽思忽相亲。\n余亦归休者，依君老此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}